      "markdown": "• Pacific Views Event Center (PVEC): Large scale or small and intimate, PVEC is the ultimate event site with an expansive ocean view.\n• La Casa at Del Mar Beach: Located right on the beach, La Casa offers water-front views for beach weddings that will exceed your expectations.\n• The Historic Beach Club at San Onofre Beach: Host a luxurious wedding or celebrate any special occasion at this beautiful location.\n• The Vineyard\n• Eagle's Landing at Marine Memorial Golf Course"
